  <!-- ============================================================
       NATIONAL PARTNERSHIPS
       ============================================================ -->
  <section id="partnerships" class="ar-section ar-navy-bg">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="ar-eyebrow mb-2" style="color:var(--ar-gold-light);">National Partnerships</p>
      <h2 class="ar-display mb-4" style="font-size:2.6rem;">Give With Joy &ndash; Together</h2>
      <div class="row g-5 align-items-center">
        <div class="col-lg-5">
          <div class="ar-photo-frame ar-ratio-4-5 rounded-1 shadow">
            <img src="https://snippets.usnsandbox.net/2026ARphotos/partnerships-give-with-joy.jpg" alt="A young Salvation Army volunteer rings a Red Kettle bell" class="ar-photo">
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-lg-7">
          <p class="ar-dropcap">At The Salvation Army, partnership is a powerful force for good. Through collaboration with national corporate partners, donors, and communities, we invite the nation to give with joy&mdash;together, turning generosity into hope and compassion into action.</p>
          <p class="mb-0">Our corporate partners advance mission-driven initiatives that reach millions each year through cause-marketing campaigns, employee engagement, and in-store and online giving opportunities. Together, we address critical needs&mdash;from hunger and housing to disaster relief and holiday assistance&mdash;while creating moments of dignity, connection, and joy. By aligning values, resources, and reach, these partnerships help ensure that hope is not only delivered&mdash;but felt&mdash;strengthening lives and communities nationwide.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

