      <h2 class="ar-display mb-4" style="font-size:2.6rem;">Influencers Leading The Way</h2>

      <div class="ar-photo-frame ar-ratio-16-9 rounded-1 shadow-sm mb-2">
        <img src="https://snippets.usnsandbox.net/2026ARphotos/influencers-group.jpg" alt="Commissioner Merle Heatwole, Buddy Valastro, and Fox &amp; Friends hosts Ainsley Earhardt and Will Cain" class="ar-photo">
